      "value": "I'd love to see this feature get added. I've been banned from a group in the past and now looking back at it, I have no reason why I was banned. I'm going through the groups posted appeal process but without that I would have no direction. Even after contacting the groups discord team it doesn't seem like they know why I was banned.",
