  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It would be great, if the moderation tool for kicking and or banning people or even for sending a warning came with a text box to add a custom reason for the warning, kick or ban that is sent to the receiver of the moderation, so they can understand exactly what they did wrong.",
